  "Start a conversation with your local AI": "与本地 AI 开始对话",
  "Use Enter to send messages and Shift + Enter for new lines. When disabled, use Ctrl/Cmd + Enter.": "按回车发送消息，Shift + 回车换行。禁用后使用 Ctrl/Cmd + 回车。",
