  "Choose the interface language.": "选择界面语言。",
  "Controls the randomness of the generated text by affecting the probability distribution of the output tokens. Higher = more random, lower = more focused.": "通过影响输出令牌的概率分布来控制生成文本的随机性。数值越高 = 越随机，越低 = 越集中。",
  "Keeps only k top tokens.": "只保留概率最高的 k 个令牌。",
  "Limits tokens to those that together have a cumulative probability of at least p": "将令牌限制为累积概率至少为 p 的集合",
  "Limits tokens based on the minimum probability for a token to be considered, relative to the probability of the most likely token.": "根据令牌被考虑所需的最小概率来限制令牌，该概率相对于最可能令牌的概率。",
  "The maximum number of token per output. Use -1 for infinite (no limit).": "每次输出的最大令牌数。使用 -1 表示无限（无限制）。",
  "Last n tokens to consider for penalizing repetition": "用于惩罚重复的最近 n 个令牌",
  "Controls the repetition of token sequences in the generated text": "控制生成文本中令牌序列的重复",
  "Limits tokens based on whether they appear in the output or not.": "根据令牌是否出现在输出中来限制令牌。",
  "Limits tokens based on how often they appear in the output.": "根据令牌在输出中出现的频率来限制令牌。",
  "Sorts and limits tokens based on the difference between log-probability and entropy.": "根据对数概率与熵之间的差异对令牌进行排序和限制。",
  "XTC sampler cuts out top tokens; this parameter controls the chance of cutting tokens at all. 0 disables XTC.": "XTC 采样器会去除高概率令牌；此参数控制去除令牌的概率。0 表示禁用 XTC。",
  "XTC sampler cuts out top tokens; this parameter controls the token probability that is required to cut that token.": "XTC 采样器会去除高概率令牌；此参数控制去除令牌所需的最低令牌概率。",
  "Maximum number of tool execution cycles before stopping (prevents infinite loops).": "停止前工具执行的最大循环次数（防止无限循环）。",
  "Timeout for individual MCP tool calls.": "单个 MCP 工具调用的超时时间。",
  "Set the llama.cpp server or OpenAI-compatible API endpoint.": "设置 llama.cpp 服务器或兼容 OpenAI 的 API 端点。",
  "The address where the Web UI is hosted.": "Web UI 所在的地址。",
  "Allow access to the Web UI from other devices.": "允许其他设备访问 Web UI。",
  "The starting message that defines how model should behave.": "定义模型行为方式的起始消息。",
  "Always display code blocks at their full natural height, overriding any height limits.": "始终以完整自然高度显示代码块，忽略所有高度限制。",
  "Always keep the sidebar visible on desktop instead of auto-hiding it.": "在桌面上始终显示侧边栏，而不是自动隐藏。",
  "Render thinking as Markdown": "将思考内容渲染为 Markdown",
  "Render user content as Markdown": "将用户内容渲染为 Markdown",
  "Show system message": "显示系统消息",
  "Show model quantization information": "显示模型量化信息",
  "Disable automatic scroll": "禁用自动滚动",
  "Parse PDF as image": "将 PDF 解析为图像",
  "Copy text attachments as plain text": "将文本附件复制为纯文本",
  "Disable reasoning content parsing": "禁用推理内容解析",
  "Exclude reasoning from context": "从上下文中排除推理",
  "Enable raw output toggle": "启用原始输出切换",
  "CSS injected into the page at runtime. Set it here, or ship it server side via the --ui-config customCss field.": "运行时注入页面的 CSS。可在此设置，或通过服务器端 --ui-config customCss 字段提供。",
  "Custom JSON parameters to send to the API. Must be valid JSON format.": "发送到 API 的自定义 JSON 参数。必须是有效的 JSON 格式。",
  "Configure MCP servers as a JSON list. Use the form in the MCP Client settings section to edit.": "以 JSON 列表形式配置 MCP 服务器。可使用 MCP 客户端设置部分的表单进行编辑。",
  "Expand thought process by default when generating messages.": "生成消息时默认展开思考过程。",
  "Render the reasoning/thinking block content as formatted Markdown instead of plain text.": "将推理/思考块内容渲染为格式化 Markdown，而不是纯文本。",
  "Strip thinking from previous messages before sending. When off, thinking is sent back via the reasoning_content field so the model sees its own chain-of-thought across turns.": "发送前从之前的消息中移除思考内容。关闭时，思考内容通过 reasoning_content 字段返回，使模型能在多轮中看到自己的思维链。",
  "Send reasoning_format=none so the server returns thinking tokens inline instead of extracting them into a separate field.": "发送 reasoning_format=none，让服务器内联返回思考令牌，而不是提取到单独的字段中。",
  "Pre-fill KV cache after response": "响应后预填充 KV 缓存",
  "After each response, re-submit the conversation to pre-fill the server KV cache. Makes the next turn faster since the prompt is already encoded while you read the response.": "每次响应后重新提交对话以预填充服务器 KV 缓存。由于提示词在您阅读响应时已编码，可使下一轮更快。",
  "Conversation title": "对话标题",
  "Use first non-empty line for the conversation title": "使用第一个非空行作为对话标题",
  "Generate title with LLM": "使用 LLM 生成标题",
  "LLM title generation prompt": "LLM 标题生成提示词",
  "Optional template for the title generation prompt. Use {{USER}} for the user message and {{ASSISTANT}} for the assistant message.": "标题生成提示词的可选模板。使用 {{USER}} 表示用户消息，{{ASSISTANT}} 表示助手消息。",
  "Choose how conversation titles are generated. The first non-empty line uses a fast deterministic rule; the LLM option uses a model-generated title from the first message exchange.": "选择对话标题的生成方式。第一个非空行使用快速的确定性规则；LLM 选项使用模型根据首次消息交流生成的标题。",
  "Display generation statistics (tokens/second, token count, duration) below each assistant message.": "在每条助手消息下方显示生成统计信息（令牌/秒、令牌数、时长）。",
  "Show toggle button to display messages as plain text instead of Markdown-formatted content": "显示切换按钮，以纯文本而非 Markdown 格式显示消息",
  "Automatically expand tool call details while executing and keep them expanded after completion.": "执行时自动展开工具调用详情，完成后保持展开状态。",
  "Automatically show microphone button instead of send button when textarea is empty for models with audio modality support.": "对于支持音频模态的模型，当文本框为空时自动显示麦克风按钮而非发送按钮。",
  "On pasting long text, it will be converted to a file. You can control the file length by setting the value of this parameter. Value 0 means disable.": "粘贴长文本时，会将其转换为文件。可通过设置此参数的值来控制文件长度。值为 0 表示禁用。",
  "Use first non-empty line for the conversation title and synced.": "使用第一个非空行作为对话标题并同步。",
  "Counterpart of the conversation title radio; stored and synced without a dedicated UI field.": "对话标题单选按钮的对应项；在无专用 UI 字段的情况下存储和同步。",
  "Images larger than this will be resized before sending to server. Set to 0 to disable.": "大于此尺寸的图像将在发送到服务器前调整大小。设置为 0 可禁用。",
  "Maximum image resolution (megapixels)": "最大图像分辨率（百万像素）",
  "Python interpreter enabled": "已启用 Python 解释器",
  "Enable Python interpreter using Pyodide. Allows running Python code in markdown code blocks.": "使用 Pyodide 启用 Python 解释器。允许在 Markdown 代码块中运行 Python 代码。",
  "JavaScript sandbox tool": "JavaScript 沙箱工具",
  "Expose a run_javascript tool to the model. Code runs in a Web Worker inside a sandboxed iframe with an opaque origin, isolated from the WebUI and its API, with a hard timeout.": "向模型公开 run_javascript 工具。代码在具有不透明源的沙箱 iframe 内的 Web Worker 中运行，与 WebUI 及其 API 隔离，并带有硬超时。",
  "Symbolic math (nerdamer)": "符号数学（nerdamer）",
